---
description: WGSL shader conventions
globs: src/**/*.wgsl
alwaysApply: false
---

- One entry point per file unless the passes are tightly coupled. Name the file after the pass: `flow_flux.wgsl`, `advect_bfecc.wgsl`.
- Every tunable value comes in through a uniform struct that mirrors a TypeScript type. Keep the struct layout notes (alignment) in a comment above it.
- Workgroup size 8×8 for 2D grid passes unless measured otherwise.
- Comment the equation each kernel implements, in plain math, at the top of the file.
- Guard grid bounds explicitly. Edge cells drain off-canvas (paint lost), they don't wrap.
